WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:05.490
I received this notice that she is
 withdrawing from the academy.

00:08.210 --> 00:10.110
Why didn't you stop her?!

00:10.320 --> 00:16.270
Enrolled students hold the right to 
receive instruction to become a hero.

00:16.270 --> 00:19.330
They are also at full liberty 
to relinquish that right.

00:20.920 --> 00:25.460
It is not my duty to stop those 
who choose to leave the academy.

00:25.460 --> 00:27.170
How can you be so heartless?!

00:27.810 --> 00:31.140
Every child must one day 
leave their parents' nest.

00:31.140 --> 00:33.500
I do consider myself an adult, you see.

00:33.990 --> 00:36.090
I wouldn't be so uncouth as to stop her.

00:36.350 --> 00:37.170
Your Majesty!

00:37.170 --> 00:39.930
I'm not done here yet! Also...

00:38.070 --> 00:39.930
Calm down a bit.

00:40.400 --> 00:41.520
Take a good look at him.

00:41.520 --> 00:42.310
Huh?

00:45.700 --> 00:46.590
Your Majesty.

00:47.120 --> 00:49.900
We'll make sure we bring Sophie back.

00:50.450 --> 00:51.420
Oh?

00:51.420 --> 00:54.660
And do you know where she's headed?

00:54.660 --> 00:57.160
She'll be looking for her five sisters.

00:57.160 --> 00:58.620
According to my investigation,

00:59.050 --> 01:02.560
it looks like they go between 
a number of different bases.

01:02.560 --> 01:04.790
Should we start looking 
at the most likely ones?

01:05.020 --> 01:05.850
Okay!

01:05.850 --> 01:06.800
Let's get going, then.

01:06.800 --> 01:08.060
Not so fast!

01:08.880 --> 01:13.950
Have you thought about 
why she went by herself?

01:14.550 --> 01:15.670
Well...

01:16.470 --> 01:20.700
Sophie didn't want any of 
you to sully your hands.

01:20.700 --> 01:21.510
What?

01:21.510 --> 01:25.680
The only way to stop those five...

01:26.140 --> 01:27.190
is to kill them.

01:27.870 --> 01:28.860
That can't be!

01:28.860 --> 01:31.250
There must be some other 
way to convince them...

01:31.960 --> 01:34.600
Those girls will stop at nothing.

01:34.600 --> 01:39.320
Sophie went alone precisely
 because she realized that.

01:40.150 --> 01:43.080
The world is more than what 
we see in the light of day,

01:43.080 --> 01:49.170
and she knows that she existed 
in the shadows to begin with.

01:49.400 --> 01:54.190
That's why she wants to put an 
end to this with her own hands.

01:54.830 --> 01:57.130
So her friends will not dirty theirs.

01:58.160 --> 02:02.650
You all need to think long and 
hard about this until dawn.

02:04.220 --> 02:09.400
<b>Episode 12</b>

02:04.220 --> 02:09.400
<b>The Sophie Series (Part 2)</b>

02:11.660 --> 02:13.480
Parent!

02:13.990 --> 02:16.910
Master, you are going to 
search for Sophie?

02:16.910 --> 02:17.750
Yeah.

02:17.750 --> 02:19.270
I'll go, too!

02:19.270 --> 02:21.490
Sophie is my friend!

02:21.740 --> 02:24.780
I shall be by your side, 
wherever you go, Master.

02:24.780 --> 02:26.470
Just the three of us, huh?

02:26.470 --> 02:29.250
Hm? I'm going, too.

02:32.200 --> 02:33.870
Did Maria agree to this as well?

02:33.870 --> 02:38.380
That crybaby said that she 
can't abandon a friend.

02:38.380 --> 02:39.750
I see.

02:39.750 --> 02:41.570
So that makes five of us.

02:41.570 --> 02:43.560
Shall we get going, Great Hero?

02:43.560 --> 02:45.560
I'm not the Great Hero anymore.

02:58.070 --> 03:00.000
Blade, you're late!

03:00.000 --> 03:01.810
See, didn't I tell you?

03:01.810 --> 03:06.080
I figured Blade was just waiting 
around the dorm entrance.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.450
What, Blade?

03:07.450 --> 03:09.010
Couldn't make up your mind?

03:09.010 --> 03:11.890
How sluggish for a superorganism.

03:11.890 --> 03:14.340
It only took me five minutes to decide!

03:15.990 --> 03:18.340
My bad for being so late!

03:18.860 --> 03:20.780
Okay, let's go!

03:38.740 --> 03:39.570
Sophie!

03:41.770 --> 03:43.700
Eliza, I found her.

03:43.700 --> 03:44.750
<i>That's a relief.</i>

03:44.750 --> 03:46.330
<i>I'll send everyone your way.</i>

03:47.040 --> 03:47.870
Please!

03:47.870 --> 03:49.220
Stop running away!

03:51.590 --> 03:54.180
Please, let's talk about this.

03:54.180 --> 03:56.360
I have a request as well.

03:56.930 --> 03:58.460
Please let me be.

03:58.460 --> 03:59.950
Sophie.

03:59.950 --> 04:06.220
We all understand how you feel, 
and what you're trying to do.

04:07.530 --> 04:09.280
So there's no need to worry...

04:09.280 --> 04:10.220
You've got it wrong.

04:10.480 --> 04:11.230
What?

04:12.080 --> 04:16.100
There's something I haven't told you.

04:20.780 --> 04:27.130
I am a human who was created for 
the Artificial Great Hero Project.

04:27.130 --> 04:28.990
Artificial... Great Hero?

04:29.650 --> 04:33.930
During the war, research was conducted 
to try and artificially produce a human

04:33.930 --> 04:37.140
with powers equal or greater 
to the Great Hero's.

04:37.140 --> 04:40.380
I was the twelfth test subject.

04:40.630 --> 04:45.190
Everyone who took part in the 
research was supposedly arrested,

04:45.190 --> 04:48.990
but I hear that some samples and 
research data have been stolen.

04:48.990 --> 04:51.640
Those five girls are the samples in question.

04:51.640 --> 04:56.070
Someone continued the research,
 incubating them and giving them commands.

04:56.570 --> 04:58.870
The reason they exist...

04:58.870 --> 05:00.520
is to surpass the Great Hero.

05:00.760 --> 05:02.150
The Great Hero...

05:02.150 --> 05:04.090
You mean the one and only?

05:04.090 --> 05:07.160
But if that's the case, 
why are they after Blade's life?

05:08.290 --> 05:09.580
Well...

05:09.580 --> 05:11.620
Oh, I get it!

05:11.620 --> 05:14.330
They want to test their capabilities 
on this superorganism!

05:14.720 --> 05:17.170
If they can't even defeat a superorganism,

05:17.170 --> 05:19.520
they stand no chance against 
the Great Hero himself.

05:19.520 --> 05:20.630
That must be it.

05:21.570 --> 05:23.380
U-Um...

05:23.380 --> 05:25.820
Yeah, sure, that's gotta be it.

05:25.820 --> 05:28.660
They can be quite dense, huh?

05:28.660 --> 05:33.170
I've caused you all so much 
trouble by getting you involved.

05:33.170 --> 05:34.620
That's not true...

05:34.620 --> 05:37.830
My past has finally caught up with me.

05:39.260 --> 05:44.680
I wondered all along whether it was okay 
to have so much fun... to be so happy.

05:45.200 --> 05:51.030
Was it okay for a human impostor like me
 to live happily as a real person?

05:51.760 --> 05:56.290
That's why I'm going back 
to where I used to be.

05:56.940 --> 05:59.230
I'll protect all of you.

05:59.230 --> 06:02.200
Even if it costs me my life.

06:03.660 --> 06:07.730
It may not have been for long, 
but being able to walk out in the sun...

06:08.160 --> 06:09.300
made me happy.

06:11.380 --> 06:12.490
Ow.

06:13.680 --> 06:16.060
Ow... that hurts.

06:16.360 --> 06:17.670
How ridiculous.

06:17.670 --> 06:21.690
If walking in the sun makes you happy, 
then keep doing it.

06:23.030 --> 06:24.940
I mean, I also used to...

06:25.220 --> 06:26.850
have eyes like <i>this</i>,

06:26.850 --> 06:29.700
and I never looked like I was 
happy or having fun, right?

06:29.700 --> 06:30.850
That's true.

06:30.850 --> 06:31.980
Huh?!

06:32.510 --> 06:36.850
But look, thanks to Blade, 
I was able to change.

06:36.850 --> 06:39.710
You turned into a bit too 
much of a lost cause, though.

06:42.270 --> 06:49.970
Besides, if killing them is the 
only solution, then we'll also...

06:50.200 --> 06:52.340
No, we won't do that.

06:52.340 --> 06:53.350
What?

06:53.350 --> 06:55.010
But His Majesty said...

06:55.010 --> 06:59.730
I know what the king said, 
but killing them isn't the answer.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.280
It's impossible.

07:02.280 --> 07:07.080
Thanks to their neural programming, 
their creator's orders are absolute.

07:07.080 --> 07:09.740
Is there nothing we can do?

07:10.200 --> 07:12.180
Even if there were...

07:12.180 --> 07:14.950
Because of all the harsh 
modifications they've undergone,

07:14.950 --> 07:17.060
they don't have much longer to live.

07:17.060 --> 07:18.500
How awful...

07:18.970 --> 07:20.480
You have a plan, right?

07:20.480 --> 07:21.730
Nope, not at all.

07:21.730 --> 07:22.730
What?!

07:23.330 --> 07:25.490
Still, I want to do something.

07:25.490 --> 07:27.990
I want to save Sophie's sisters.

07:27.990 --> 07:29.340
Sisters...

07:30.100 --> 07:33.220
Which is why I want all of you to help.

07:39.560 --> 07:42.000
Sophie, are you okay with that?

07:44.770 --> 07:45.760
Sophie.

07:45.760 --> 07:48.040
Give your life to me.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.000
What?!

07:49.000 --> 07:49.680
Okay.

07:49.680 --> 07:51.240
That was fast! Are you sure?!

07:51.950 --> 07:54.190
I mean... that's... He just....

07:52.300 --> 07:54.190
What are you getting 
worked up about, Earnest?

07:54.190 --> 07:55.710
I-I get it!

07:55.710 --> 07:58.700
You want to be friends 
with those girls, right?

07:58.700 --> 08:00.370
Okay, let's do it.

08:02.820 --> 08:04.880
So, do you have any good ideas?

08:05.130 --> 08:07.100
You're leaving it all to me?!

08:07.520 --> 08:09.760
Well, sure, I don't mind.

08:09.760 --> 08:12.260
I've come up with a plan.

08:19.520 --> 08:21.810
Let me know when you can't move anymore.

08:21.810 --> 08:23.230
I'll dispose of you.

08:23.230 --> 08:24.200
Huh?!

08:24.200 --> 08:25.840
You know I'm still good to go!

08:25.840 --> 08:27.040
I'll crush you!

08:27.040 --> 08:29.260
I still wanna destroy more!

08:29.260 --> 08:30.850
Destroy! Destroy!

08:32.990 --> 08:35.780
Yes, very good.

08:37.170 --> 08:42.290
The only reason you exist is 
to transcend the Great Hero.

08:42.790 --> 08:44.930
Kill the Great Hero.

08:44.930 --> 08:48.290
Kill, kill, kill.

08:50.140 --> 08:51.420
Une.

08:51.420 --> 08:53.510
I found this outside.

08:53.960 --> 08:55.400
A letter of challenge.

08:55.400 --> 08:56.640
It must be a trap.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.620
We'll put an end to this.

09:17.850 --> 09:20.660
Do you really think they'll 
answer that challenge?

09:21.040 --> 09:22.400
It's fine.

09:22.400 --> 09:24.520
I know I would go for sure.

09:24.520 --> 09:26.040
I-I see...

09:26.450 --> 09:27.420
Sniff, sniff...

09:27.930 --> 09:30.290
I smell the same scent as Sophie!

09:31.100 --> 09:32.050
They have arrived.

09:34.990 --> 09:36.300
I've been waiting.

09:37.390 --> 09:39.220
We'll kill you.

09:39.220 --> 09:41.310
That is what we exist to do.

09:41.610 --> 09:42.970
I see.

09:42.970 --> 09:45.810
I was hoping I could be 
friends with all of you.

09:46.480 --> 09:48.540
<i>You understand the plan, right?</i>

09:48.540 --> 09:50.810
<i>You will be the only one fighting.</i>

09:51.370 --> 09:54.680
<i>If we attack as a group, 
they're sure to run away.</i>

09:54.680 --> 09:57.150
<i>However, with only one target,</i>

09:57.150 --> 10:00.320
<i>they should continue to fight, 
even knowing that it's a trap.</i>

10:03.740 --> 10:04.960
Blade...

10:04.960 --> 10:08.000
I know the plan,
but not being able to help...

10:12.000 --> 10:13.040
<i>Listen up!</i>

10:13.040 --> 10:16.510
<i>The goal is not to defeat them, 
but to deplete their energy.</i>

10:13.750 --> 10:15.560
C'mon, die!

10:15.560 --> 10:16.510
Adamantine Body!

10:17.760 --> 10:20.840
<i>Please endure all of their attacks.</i>

10:19.640 --> 10:20.840
Destroy! Destroy!

10:27.160 --> 10:29.360
Easy for you to say!

10:29.360 --> 10:31.190
<i>I know the superorganism can pull it off!</i>

10:31.840 --> 10:33.940
If you manage to deplete their energy...

10:33.940 --> 10:37.190
Be on constant lookout, 
and don't break the blockade!

10:37.190 --> 10:40.850
There must be someone
 giving orders to the five of them.

10:40.850 --> 10:42.200
Make sure you capture them.

10:43.920 --> 10:46.240
Now <i>this</i> is a realistic exercise!

10:46.240 --> 10:48.510
No, it's the real deal!

10:48.510 --> 10:50.710
We'll arrest the person who created them.

10:50.710 --> 10:54.590
Then, we'll make them tell us the 
parameters to reprogram and save them!

10:54.860 --> 10:56.840
<i>So... please don't die!</i>

10:59.070 --> 11:00.560
Hi-yah!

11:02.710 --> 11:05.180
Hey, teach me again.

11:05.180 --> 11:06.140
How to kill you!

11:07.900 --> 11:08.520
Oh, no!

11:13.120 --> 11:13.770
Blade!

11:15.210 --> 11:17.410
Have faith in Blade.

11:17.410 --> 11:18.480
I know!

11:18.480 --> 11:19.790
I know that...

11:19.790 --> 11:20.650
But still!

11:30.900 --> 11:32.540
He can still use moves like that?

11:33.360 --> 11:35.460
Not being able to do anything...

11:35.460 --> 11:37.290
Other than sit and watch...

11:37.290 --> 11:38.230
Anna.

11:38.830 --> 11:41.300
There's still something 
we can do, isn't there?

11:46.680 --> 11:48.680
Artificial Great Hero Power.

11:51.440 --> 11:54.990
Deadly Earth Crash!

11:56.020 --> 11:57.690
What?! The ground...

11:57.940 --> 12:00.440
Be crushed by the planet, and die!

12:02.510 --> 12:05.490
Three! Two! One!

12:12.180 --> 12:13.730
I'll send you to heaven.

12:13.730 --> 12:15.420
Artificial Great Hero Power!

12:19.250 --> 12:21.010
Are they all real?

12:23.230 --> 12:24.130
Blade!

12:24.130 --> 12:25.140
Take this!

12:31.890 --> 12:32.810
Blade!

12:34.140 --> 12:35.810
Dragon Smash!

12:39.020 --> 12:40.170
Too bad.

12:40.170 --> 12:41.740
This is the end.

12:43.940 --> 12:45.910
Artificial Great Hero Power.

12:46.240 --> 12:49.740
I'll wipe you out, jackass!

12:49.740 --> 12:50.660
Blade!

12:54.800 --> 12:57.840
This is the Super God Technique, 
Absolutely Unbreakable Barrier.

12:57.840 --> 13:00.170
Ugh, <i>that</i> sure is a name.

13:00.880 --> 13:02.290
So this is it...

13:05.140 --> 13:05.680
Ah...

13:06.040 --> 13:06.930
No way!

13:11.190 --> 13:12.680
Earnest, hand that over!

13:13.030 --> 13:14.700
Huh? But your sword...

13:14.700 --> 13:15.990
Believe in me!

13:16.720 --> 13:17.310
Okay!

13:19.310 --> 13:22.320
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

13:23.320 --> 13:23.840
Ah!

13:23.840 --> 13:25.060
I've got this.

13:25.060 --> 13:26.490
Artificial Great Hero Power.

13:30.510 --> 13:31.350
Blade.

13:31.890 --> 13:34.160
Take control of this power.

13:34.780 --> 13:37.710
It should be easier for the 
real Great Hero, right?

13:38.120 --> 13:39.400
Are you sure?

13:39.400 --> 13:40.710
It'll be pretty painful.

13:41.430 --> 13:43.970
My life belongs to you.

13:44.400 --> 13:45.720
Use it all you want.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.970
Artificial Great Hero Power!

13:50.970 --> 13:52.370
Great Hero Power!

14:02.980 --> 14:05.260
You did well, Sophie.

14:05.260 --> 14:06.380
Blade...

14:06.380 --> 14:07.320
Take this.

14:18.290 --> 14:21.330
Um, what was that move called again?

14:21.330 --> 14:23.250
Well, whatever works, I guess.

14:23.690 --> 14:26.010
Earnest Monster Beam!

14:26.010 --> 14:28.510
Hey! Don't give it a weird name!

15:04.470 --> 15:05.840
What's wrong?

15:05.840 --> 15:07.300
Not gonna finish me off?

15:08.980 --> 15:10.300
My time is up.

15:10.760 --> 15:11.650
Time?

15:12.150 --> 15:13.260
What does that mean?

15:14.430 --> 15:15.300
Huh?

15:18.140 --> 15:19.320
H-Hey!

15:19.320 --> 15:20.440
By time, you don't mean...

15:23.040 --> 15:24.430
Snap out of it!

15:24.430 --> 15:25.440
Hey!

15:25.440 --> 15:30.370
Our lifespan... measured in days...

15:30.960 --> 15:32.200
is fourteen days.

15:33.160 --> 15:36.950
Until... sunset today.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.490
How beautiful...

15:41.760 --> 15:42.810
Eliza!

15:42.810 --> 15:43.960
You heard her, right?!

15:44.320 --> 15:45.500
There's no time left!

15:45.500 --> 15:46.960
We're out of time!

15:48.410 --> 15:52.130
I just finished looking over 
the research data from

15:52.130 --> 15:54.470
the modification facility 
where they were born.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.960
What atrocious workmanship.

15:57.960 --> 16:01.980
I'd say they were lucky to 
last fourteen whole days...

16:02.490 --> 16:03.900
Blade...

16:03.900 --> 16:04.980
It's not working!

16:05.340 --> 16:06.860
I can't heal them!

16:07.820 --> 16:10.990
The powers of the Great Hero and 
Demon King defy the laws of physics.

16:11.490 --> 16:13.600
They disrupt the laws of cause and effect.

16:13.600 --> 16:17.510
Claire's powers work by decreasing entropy.

16:17.510 --> 16:19.490
They won't work when 
causality has been severed.

16:19.780 --> 16:22.990
Isn't there some way to save them?!

16:22.990 --> 16:23.950
That's right!

16:24.360 --> 16:26.450
There's the person who made 
Une and the others, right?!

16:26.450 --> 16:27.680
If we ask them...

16:27.680 --> 16:28.800
It's no use.

16:30.000 --> 16:32.000
We did find their creator.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.130
However...

16:34.480 --> 16:35.930
He's dead!

16:37.730 --> 16:39.400
And not within the last fourteen days!

16:39.400 --> 16:40.430
Long before that...

16:40.960 --> 16:44.530
By the time they were born,
 he was already dead!

16:44.530 --> 16:47.880
The truth is... that there 
never were any commands...

16:48.350 --> 16:51.400
Can't you do something with 
that science of yours?

16:52.320 --> 16:53.810
I could do research.

16:54.320 --> 16:59.880
With my intellect, I might be able 
to find a way to reprogram them.

16:59.880 --> 17:01.910
But there's not enough time.

17:03.550 --> 17:05.520
<i>Science has its limits as well.</i>

17:06.010 --> 17:08.920
<i>It can't solve everything 
in the snap of your fingers!</i>

17:12.500 --> 17:13.660
<i>Damn it all!</i>

17:13.660 --> 17:17.140
<i>If only I was more of a genius!</i>

17:17.140 --> 17:18.150
Blade.

17:19.180 --> 17:23.850
Bring all of them... my sisters, here.

17:25.900 --> 17:26.900
Une.

17:26.900 --> 17:28.380
Wake up.

17:29.690 --> 17:33.440
You still haven't used your 
Artificial Great Hero Power.

17:36.090 --> 17:37.840
You will all die,

17:38.320 --> 17:42.950
but there's a way for you to keep living.

17:44.370 --> 17:46.260
I failed to carry out my orders.

17:46.770 --> 17:49.960
What point is there in living?

17:50.290 --> 17:51.950
You can surpass me.

17:51.950 --> 17:54.980
Keep on living, and try to surpass me.

17:55.590 --> 17:57.010
If you can, that is.

17:58.870 --> 18:01.720
Hmm, that sounds pretty fun.

18:01.950 --> 18:03.430
There's no way...

18:03.430 --> 18:05.980
But the chances aren't zero.

18:07.650 --> 18:10.110
I might win if it was a different activity.

18:11.210 --> 18:12.610
Destroy, destroy...

18:14.730 --> 18:15.520
Une.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.710
I understand.

18:20.820 --> 18:23.550
Artificial Great Hero Power.

18:24.500 --> 18:25.470
Blade.

18:26.080 --> 18:28.200
Take control of her power.

18:29.100 --> 18:33.680
So that their souls... 
their minds... enter me.

18:34.130 --> 18:34.860
Okay.

18:35.320 --> 18:35.880
Leave it to me.

19:15.840 --> 19:19.070
Um... are you Une?

19:19.070 --> 19:20.320
That's right.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.780
What's wrong?

19:21.780 --> 19:24.330
I just came to see if 
you were feeling better.

19:24.330 --> 19:27.660
When you are, I'll be the one to kill you.

19:27.660 --> 19:28.520
Don't forget it.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.130
Yeah.

19:30.130 --> 19:31.950
That's what you all say.

19:32.540 --> 19:33.770
What about the others?

19:34.680 --> 19:37.420
They say they want to talk to you.

19:37.420 --> 19:38.730
But before that...

19:42.490 --> 19:43.580
Sophie?

19:43.580 --> 19:44.690
Yes.

19:44.690 --> 19:47.140
It looks like my sisters let me take control.

19:47.710 --> 19:49.380
Sounds like you have it rough.

19:49.920 --> 19:50.790
Is everything okay?

19:51.340 --> 19:52.370
Well...

19:52.960 --> 19:55.040
It feels like having six children.

19:56.000 --> 19:56.940
Six?

19:57.660 --> 19:59.050
Isn't that one too many?

20:04.050 --> 20:09.110
<i>The sunny disposition that 
brings a smile to your face</i>

20:09.110 --> 20:14.860
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

20:14.860 --> 20:20.030
<i>They may be a part of me, 
but that's not all there is</i>

20:20.030 --> 20:22.730
<i>That image of me</i>

20:22.730 --> 20:25.450
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

20:25.450 --> 20:28.120
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

20:28.120 --> 20:30.540
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

20:30.540 --> 20:35.230
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

20:35.890 --> 20:38.650
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

20:38.650 --> 20:41.320
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

20:41.320 --> 20:43.990
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

20:43.990 --> 20:46.980
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

20:46.980 --> 20:49.410
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

20:49.410 --> 20:53.690
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

20:53.690 --> 20:59.170
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

20:59.170 --> 21:01.010
<i>It's a sign</i>

21:25.780 --> 21:27.800
Ah, it's hopeless!

21:28.110 --> 21:29.970
It's <i>my</i> turn!

21:34.860 --> 21:38.120
Now this is a <i>true</i> realistic exercise!

21:38.120 --> 21:38.870
Gil.

21:39.250 --> 21:41.570
About the magical beast brought here today...

21:42.100 --> 21:45.820
I received word that there's been a mix-up.

21:46.340 --> 21:49.690
It seems they delivered a different 
beast than the one you ordered.

21:49.690 --> 21:51.830
I thought it was a little too powerful.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.330
Looks like I'm going to be busy.

21:57.270 --> 21:58.710
Knock 'em dead!

21:58.830 --> 21:58.960
<b>Final Ep!! Good Work!!</b>

22:03.730 --> 22:05.260
Blargh...

22:05.260 --> 22:07.260
Hi-yah-yah-yah!

22:09.010 --> 22:11.470
Hi-yah-yah-yah...

22:12.820 --> 22:14.530
Hey, Asmodeus!

22:14.530 --> 22:16.020
You can do better than that!

22:16.550 --> 22:18.080
No more...

22:18.080 --> 22:19.770
I'm really done for...

22:19.770 --> 22:21.120
My lord!

22:21.120 --> 22:22.270
Let us fight in tandem!

22:22.910 --> 22:24.530
Why me?!

22:28.480 --> 22:30.180
Please, everyone.

22:32.940 --> 22:33.840
I've got this.

22:33.840 --> 22:34.790
Dragon Smash!

22:34.790 --> 22:35.790
Hi-yah!

22:37.130 --> 22:37.790
Like this.

22:38.010 --> 22:38.790
Destroy!

22:38.790 --> 22:40.790
Artificial Great Hero Power!

22:43.800 --> 22:45.300
How many does that make?

22:45.300 --> 22:46.550
I'll land the final blow—

22:49.510 --> 22:50.850
Bow before me!

22:51.250 --> 22:53.300
According to my high-spec calculations...

22:55.100 --> 22:56.380
No effect.

23:00.050 --> 23:02.060
It really doesn't look good.

23:09.280 --> 23:11.820
Oh, there's no need to worry.

23:21.990 --> 23:25.500
After all, he's the Great Hero!

23:25.500 --> 23:26.300
Hmm?

23:26.900 --> 23:28.670
What's wrong, everyone?

23:30.260 --> 23:32.540
Mmm! This tonkatsu curry's so good!

23:32.540 --> 23:34.010
You lousy...

23:34.580 --> 23:37.660
Superorganism!
